This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Elastic Beanstalk application and configures an application version lifecycle policy. It also creates an IAM service role that Elastic Beanstalk can assume to manage application versions, an S3 bucket to store the application source bundle, and an initial Elastic Beanstalk application version backed by a generated ZIP archive.

